  "scope": "The regression links the production environment.rs setter to the actual C bridge and existing C-core early-prefill reader. It first reproduces the old Rust-only failure, then verifies startup assignments, overrides, empty values, invalid arguments and wide values. Empty OS values remain present for Rust while the CRT entry is cleared, matching native CLI flag semantics. The built Windows service passes all42 server tests. No real model request is included here; the repaired environment can activate options previously hidden from the C core, so existing HTTP evidence is not transferred to the new executable.",
